---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/development_roadmap.astro
import { discordInviteLink, site } from '$data/site_content';
---

<section id="roadmap" class="scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand dark:text-brand-soft">Built in the open</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.08] md:text-5xl">
          Help write<br><em>the next chapter.</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          We’re starting small: make the authored adventure reliable, then connect resident lives,
          meaningful consequences, and playable campaign creation. Community-made adventures are
          part of that longer journey.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="self-center">
        <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-medium">What we’re working toward</h3>
        <ol class="mt-4 divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
          <li class="flex gap-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">01</span
            ><span>A better first adventure</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">02</span
            ><span>Residents and towns that respond</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">03</span
            ><span>Campaigns made playable</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-2 border-t border-border pt-6">
      <a
        href={site.social.github}
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-medium text-brand dark:text-brand-soft no-underline hover:underline"
        >Follow development <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
      >
      <a
        href={discordInviteLink}
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand"
        >Join Discord</a
      >
      <a
        href={`${site.social.github}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand"
        >Contribute</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
